From: clx overlay
Subject: [PATCH] compat: build sgl-attn hopper/utils.h against cutlass >= 4.7

cutlass 4.7 templatized SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS, moving the type/shape/major
parameters from the MMA_Traits argument list into the atom template itself.
The old-style signature no longer parses against the new headers
("argument list for class template is missing").

This overload takes a TiledMMA constructed from the old-style atom, which
does not exist with cutlass >= 4.7, and has no callers in the sgl-kernel
build tree (flashinfer provides its own copy in fmha_common.hpp). Make the
signature version-conditional so it keeps parsing on both old and new
cutlass; the body is only instantiated if it is ever called.

Neither cute/tensor.hpp nor cutlass/cutlass.h pulls in cutlass/version.h,
so include it explicitly; CUTLASS_VERSION is only defined under
CUTLASS_VERSIONS_GENERATED, hence the check uses the unconditionally
defined CUTLASS_MAJOR/CUTLASS_MINOR macros.

--- a/hopper/utils.h
+++ b/hopper/utils.h
@@ -19,5 +19,6 @@
 
 #include <cutlass/cutlass.h>
+#include <cutlass/version.h>
 #include <cutlass/array.h>
 #include <cutlass/numeric_conversion.h>
 #include <cutlass/numeric_types.h>
@@ -415,9 +416,17 @@
 to_tiled_mma_sm100_ts(
     TiledMMA<MMA_Atom<
-      MMA_Traits<SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS, a_type, b_type, c_type,
-                    cute::C<M>, cute::C<N>,
-                    cute::integral_constant<UMMA::Major, a_major>,
-                    cute::integral_constant<UMMA::Major, b_major>,
-                    cute::integral_constant<UMMA::ScaleIn, a_neg>,
-                    cute::integral_constant<UMMA::ScaleIn, b_neg>>,
+      // cutlass 4.7+ templatizes SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS (parameters moved
+      // from the MMA_Traits argument list into the atom template itself);
+      // the old-style atom does not exist there.
+#if (CUTLASS_MAJOR > 4) || (CUTLASS_MAJOR == 4 && CUTLASS_MINOR >= 7)
+      SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS<a_type, b_type, c_type,
+                          M, N, a_major, b_major, a_neg, b_neg>,
+#else
+      MMA_Traits<SM100_MMA_F8F6F4_SS, a_type, b_type, c_type,
+                    cute::C<M>, cute::C<N>,
+                    cute::integral_constant<UMMA::Major, a_major>,
+                    cute::integral_constant<UMMA::Major, b_major>,
+                    cute::integral_constant<UMMA::ScaleIn, a_neg>,
+                    cute::integral_constant<UMMA::ScaleIn, b_neg>>,
+#endif
       TAs...>, TMs...>) {
